   READING.  A ratio near one means the plug-in critical value agrees with a
   dependence-respecting null; far above one is the conservatism the paper is
   about.  The p-values are resolution-limited: the bootstrap cannot report
   below 1/999 = 0.0010, the weighted chi^2 below 1/20000 = 5e-05.
